  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "PRESET"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The stage is almost completely dark."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The marketplace exists in the shadows, but the audience cannot yet clearly see it."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Villagers may already be preset in place behind the darkness."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "A warm special rises on NIA."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "A second special reveals SIMON."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "For the opening moments of the production, the entire world belongs to these two children."
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CHILD STORYTELLERS"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Have you ever heard of Nazareth?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SIMON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Probably not."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Simon."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SIMON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "What? It’s true."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "We’re not Jerusalem."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SIMON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No palace."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "No great temple."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SIMON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And if Caesar ever came through here—"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "He was lost."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SIMON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Very lost."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "They share a look."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "But it’s home."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SIMON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Which means everybody knows everybody."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Who your family is."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SIMON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Where you work."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Who you’re talking to."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SIMON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Who you’re supposed to be talking to."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "And if you don’t know your own business—"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SIMON"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "text": "Someone will explain it to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "They grin."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "NIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Welcome to Nazareth."
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "music",
      "text": "LIGHT CUE — VILLAGE REVEAL"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "ON “NAZARETH!” THE ENTIRE STAGE BURSTS INTO WARM, VIBRANT LIGHT."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "For the first time, the audience sees the full marketplace."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The village is already moving."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The light catches"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "● merchants arranging goods;"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "● villagers carrying baskets;"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "● fabric opening across stalls;"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "● workers moving crates;"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "● bread being displayed;"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "● children weaving through adults;"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "● carpenters working;"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "● women sweeping;"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "● neighbors greeting one another;"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "● shoppers bargaining;"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "● jewelry being arranged;"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "● clothing and cloth being displayed;"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "● water being carried;"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "● families beginning their day."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The audience should feel as though Nia and Simon have suddenly opened a window into a world that was already alive."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "HAMMER."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "CLAP."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "STEP."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "BASKET."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "FABRIC SNAP."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Christian's orchestration catches the practical rhythms of the village."
    },
    {
      "type": "music",
      "text": "MUSIC STARTS"
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "OPENING MUSICAL HOOK"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COMPANY"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "OHHH-OH, OOOH-OOH-OOH..."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "WELCOME TO NAZARETH!"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COMPANY"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "OOOH-OOOH-OOOH..."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "WELCOME TO NAZARETH!"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "The marketplace expands into full choreography."
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Nia and Simon are absorbed naturally into the village."
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "music",
      "text": "VERSE 1 — VILLAGE DIALOGUES"
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "DIALOGUE 1-“EVERYBODY KNOWS YOUR BUSINESS”"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "*Directly establishes the theme that everybody in Nazareth knows everybody—and their business. *"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "The marketplace is moving rapidly. A MERCHANT sees a MAN approaching."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "MERCHANT-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Hello! Your usual?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "CUSTOMER-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Actually, today I thought—"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "MERCHANT-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Your wife already came by."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "CUSTOMER-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "She did?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "MERCHANT-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "She said, “Don’t sell him anything we don’t need.”"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "CUSTOMER-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "She’s not even here."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "GOSSIPER-2"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "She doesn’t need to be."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "CUSTOMER-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "I don’t even know what I’m buying."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "MERCHANT-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "We’ll tell you when we hear."
    },
    {
      "type": "music",
      "text": "Music punches forward."
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "DIALOGUE 2- “NAZARETH BARGAINING”"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "*Gives the marketplace more of a fast Broadway-comedy feeling.*"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "A WOMAN examines an item at a merchant's stall."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "WOMAN CUSTOMER-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "How much?"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "MERCHANT-2"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Three."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "WOMAN CUSTOMER-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Two."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "WOMAN CUSTOMER-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Two—and I tell everybody you're generous."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "MERCHANT-2"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Three—and you tell nobody anything."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "GOSSIPER-4"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Too late. I heard two."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "MERCHANT-2"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "I haven't sold it yet!"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "GOSSIPER 1 & 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Give us a minute!"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Everyone moves."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "MERCHANT-2"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "I need a different village."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "WOMAN CUSTOMER-1"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "They'd hear about you there too."
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "music",
      "text": "CHORUS 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "COMPANY"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "[WELCOME TO NAZARETH — CHORUS]"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "The marketplace opens wider."
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "The choreography celebrates the life of the village"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "● basket exchanges becoming partner turns;"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "● fabric moving overhead;"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "● children weaving through formations;"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "● merchants shifting stalls;"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "● couples turning through the marketplace;"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "● rhythmic clapping;"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "● sweeping diagonals;"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "● groups forming and reforming;"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "● everyday work becoming dance."
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "The movement should feel as though Nazareth itself creates the rhythm."
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "music",
      "text": "VERSE 2 — MARY AND HER FRIENDS"
    },
    {
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "MARY enters with SHIRA, TALIA, ADINA and DAFNA."
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "They are working among fabrics, garments, jewelry and marketplace goods."
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "The music continues underneath their dialogue."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ADINA"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Mary, we're late."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "We are not late."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TALIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "We are if someone is waiting for us."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DAFNA"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Someone is waiting for Mary."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Dafna."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DAFNA"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "I didn't say who."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TALIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "You didn't need to."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SHIRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Can we discuss Mary's future while walking?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DAFNA"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Absolutely."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Can we not discuss Mary's future at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "SHIRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "You keep looking for him."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "I'm not looking for anyone."
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Talia catches Mary glancing across the marketplace."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "TALIA"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "That is clearly untrue."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DAFNA"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Joseph."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "I know who she means."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DAFNA"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Then we're all caught up."
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Mary laughs."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "ADINA"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Good. Now move."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DAFNA"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "You see how she speaks to us?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MARY"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Move, Dafna."
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "DAFNA"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Now there are two of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "The women laugh and are swept back into the choreography."
    },
    {
      "type": "spacer",
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "music",
      "text": "MUSICAL TRANSITION INTO VERSE 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "A carpentry rhythm emerges."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "HAMMER."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "HAMMER."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "WOOD."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "CLAP."
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "text": "STEP."
    },
    {
      "type": "music",
      "text": "VERSE 2 (con.) — JOSEPH AND HIS FRIENDS"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "A carpentry rhythm emerges: HAMMER. HAMMER. WOOD. CLAP. STEP. JOSEPH enters with LEVI, MALACHI, CALEB and EZRA."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Caleb."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CALEB"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Don’t say it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "It’s crooked."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CALEB"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "It’s artistic."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "EZRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "It is crooked artistically."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LEVI"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Give it here."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CALEB"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Why does everyone assume I need help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "The piece slips. Levi catches it."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LEVI"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Instinct."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MALACHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Experience."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "EZRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Evidence."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CALEB"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Joseph, defend me."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "It still holds. That is not the same as being right."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CALEB"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "I withdraw my request."
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "The men laugh."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LEVI"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Enjoy this while you can."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Enjoy what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CALEB"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Freedom."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "I’m getting married. I’m not being arrested."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "EZRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "There are similarities in the paperwork."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "MALACHI"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Ezra."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "EZRA"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "I said paperwork."
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Laugh."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "LEVI"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Does Mary know how much time you spend talking to wood?"
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "JOSEPH"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "The wood listens better than all of you."
    },
    {
      "type": "character",
      "text": "CALEB"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Then marry the wood."
    },
    {
