      "type": "character",
      "text": "GOSSIPER 4"
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "Everybody knoooows, mi amoooor."
    },
    {
      "type": "lyric",
      "text": "The gossipers hurry away. The dancers reclaim center stage. The number builds through its dance climax into the final company chorus and button."
